OL,3,GNEWSAJagtar Singh Johal freed on bail
OL,4,Aafter nine years in Indian prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Scottish Sikh activist has been
OL,7,Freleased from prison in India after
OL,8,Fbeing detained for almost nine years
OL,9,Fwithout being convicted.
OL,11,FJagtar Singh Johal thanked "the
OL,12,Falmighty" as he walked free from gate
OL,13,Fthree of the Tihar Prison complex in
OL,14,FDelhi.
OL,16,FThe 39-year-old from Dumbarton was
OL,17,Farrested in 2017 over allegations he
OL,18,Fhad a role in a series of targeted
OL,19,Fkillings of religious and political
OL,20,Ffigures - which he denies.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
